5. Changed Functions
========================================

- OpenSSL:
  . openssl_x509_checkpurpose() now accepts an $x509_verify_flags parameter,
    a combination of the new OPENSSL_X509_VERIFY_FLAG_CRL_CHECK,
    OPENSSL_X509_VERIFY_FLAG_CRL_CHECK_ALL and
    OPENSSL_X509_VERIFY_FLAG_PARTIAL_CHAIN constants. CRLs are supplied as
    files in $ca_info. Default behavior is unchanged.

